{'symbol': 'GWW', 'date': '2022-09-27 14:00:00', 'title': 'GRAINGER NAMED ONE OF THE FORTUNE BEST WORKPLACES FOR WOMEN™ IN 2022', 'text': 'CHICAGO , SEPT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GRAINGER (NYSE: GWW), THE LEADING BROAD LINE DISTRIBUTOR OF MAINTENANCE, REPAIR AND OPERATING (MRO) PRODUCTS SERVING BUSINESSES AND INSTITUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED BY GREAT PLACE TO WORK® AND FORTUNE MAGAZINE AS ONE OF THE 2022 BEST WORKPLACES FOR WOMEN.'}